Scope of the MIT License in this repository

The MIT License above covers the source code of this repository and its
documentation. It does not cover the following data files. The third-party
records they contain remain subject to the terms of their publishers, as
described in the NOTICE file:

  data/*.sqlite
  frontend/data/registers/*.json and frontend/data/countries.json
  frontend/app/[locale]/playground/captured-iban.json
  src/db/*.json
  scripts/data/**
  src/lib/fi-register.ts, for its list of bank codes
  any other file that NOTICE lists as a data file, and any file of this
  repository that reproduces records from those publishers, such as
  exported API responses and test fixtures
